---
// frontend/src/pages/index.astro
import '../styles/globals.css';
---

<html lang="ko">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>AAA TEAM 하이브리드 게이트웨이</title>
		<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
	</head>
	<body class="bg-neutral-950 text-neutral-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between p-8 font-sans">
		
		<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto my-auto text-center flex flex-col gap-6">
			<div class="flex justify-center mb-2">
				<span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400 font-bold bg-neutral-900 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-neutral-800">
					Astro SSG Gateway
				</span>
			</div>
			
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">
				AAA TEAM <span class="text-yellow-400 font-extrabold">공식 연구 아카이브</span>
			</h1>
			
			<p className="text-neutral-400 text-base max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
				Obsidian 지식 창고로부터 정밀 변환 및 보안 필터링을 거쳐 배포되는 초고속 정적 리서치 아카이브입니다. 실시간 파이프라인 제어반은 동적 대시보드로 즉시 라우팅됩니다.
			</p>
			
			<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mt-6">
				<a 
					href="/dashboard" 
					class="px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-yellow-400 text-neutral-950 font-bold text-sm hover:bg-yellow-300 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-yellow-500/10"
				>
					실시간 대시보드 진입 (/dashboard)
				</a>
				<a 
					href="https://github.com/git2583/aaa-git2583-vault" 
					target="_blank"
					class="px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-neutral-900 text-neutral-300 font-bold text-sm hover:bg-neutral-850 border border-neutral-800 transition-colors"
				>
					Private Obsidian Vault 
				</a>
			</div>
		</main>

		<footer class="text-center text-xs text-neutral-600 mt-16">
			<p>© 2026 AAA TEAM by Selfish Club · Powered by Antigravity 2.0 Hybrid Architecture</p>
		</footer>

	</body>
</html>
